ass=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Hanover County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025, on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids. September to October came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those years, more than any other pair. In 2025, October to November came in at 45% of normal on the middle of the grids. So far in 2026, March to April sits at 35% of normal and June to July at 132% on the middle of the grids.</p>"}
